┌────────────────┐      (1) Requests JWT Token      ┌────────────────┐
│ GitHub Actions │ ───────────────────────────────> │  GitHub OIDC   │
│     Runner     │ <─────────────────────────────── │    Provider    │
└────────────────┘       (2) Issues Signed JWT      └────────────────┘
        │
        │ (3) Exchanges JWT via AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
        ▼
┌────────────────┐
│    AWS STS     │ ── (4) Checks your OpenID Connect Provider Config
└────────────────┘        & matches Repo/Branch in the Trust Policy.
        │
        ▼
   Handshake Valid! 🔑 Returns temporary security credentials (valid for ~1 hour).
